# Contents ignored; a file is negated only once proven machine-independent and not rewritten by
# the IDE import. `misc.xml` pins the JDK this machine happens to have, `vcs.xml` is regenerated
# on open, and `.idea/.gitignore` is redundant with the deny-all above it.
.idea/*
!.idea/modules.xml
!.idea/lightsystem-plugins.iml
